  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO RUN IT\n\nSet Speed to Instant and give\nthe work box to the Follower.\n\nNow move the pointer over the\ntable. The star follows your\nhand.\n\nIt dozes between moves: with\nnothing on the pointer nest\nthere is nothing to match."
   },
   "x": -0.75,
   "z": 2.15
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "THE TEST OF A DESIGN\n\nNothing in these four steps\nis about pointers, and\nnothing is about position.\nThe robot copies a box, moves\na thing into a hole, and\ngives it to a bird -- three\ngestures it could already do.\n\nThe device and the message\nwere designed a week apart\nand fit because both are\nDATA and neither is a\nfeature."
